CM 7-el Yagi @255 MHz — optimized compromise: SWR < 2, gain high
CM Elements along Z; boom along X; units = meters (20 mm dia)
CM forw: 90, 70 ; back: 90, 250
CE

' wire & solver settings
SY rw=0.01' 20 mm dia
SY seg=41
SY freq=255

' Element lengths (meters) - compromise / tuned
SY Lr=0.518816' reflector (slightly shortened)
SY Ld=0.509829' driven
SY L1=0.70045' director1 (slightly longer)
SY L2=0.854717
SY L3=0.667661' director3 slightly increased
SY L4=0.523944
SY L5=0.566801

' Half-length helpers
SY hr=Lr/2
SY hd=Ld/2
SY h1=L1/2
SY h2=L2/2
SY h3=L3/2
SY h4=L4/2
SY h5=L5/2

' X positions (absolute, meters) - slight boom increase (x5 moved forward)
SY xr=-0.20762' reflector x position (behind driven)
SY xd=0.0' driven x
SY x1=0.188159
SY x2=0.390464
SY x3=0.718458
SY x4=1.098797
SY x5=1.451612' outer director moved +0.01 m

' Geometry (GW lines use single symbols only)
GW 1 41  xr 0 -hr   xr 0 hr  rw    ' Reflector
GW 2 41  xd 0 -hd   xd 0 hd  rw    ' Driven (feed at center)
GW 3 41  x1 0 -h1   x1 0 h1  rw    ' Director 1
GW 4 41  x2 0 -h2   x2 0 h2  rw    ' Director 2
GW 5 41  x3 0 -h3   x3 0 h3  rw    ' Director 3
GW 6 41  x4 0 -h4   x4 0 h4  rw    ' Director 4
GW 7 41  x5 0 -h5   x5 0 h5  rw    ' Director 5

GE 0
GN -1

' Feed at center segment (seg=41 -> center=21)
EX 0 2 21 0 1 0

' Frequency & pattern request
FR,0,1,0,0,255
PQ -1
PT -1
RP,0,37,73,1003,-180,0,5,5
